  "description": "Create a vine on a surface and make a melee spell attack against a creature within 30 feet of it. A hit deals 4d8 Bludgeoning damage and pulls the target up to 30 feet; a Huge or smaller target is also Grappled. The vine holds one creature at a time, can release it freely, and can repeat the attack as a Bonus Action. **Higher-Level Slots.** It can grapple one additional creature per slot level above 4.",
